  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "SynFutures is an onchain trading protocol and decentralized exchange focused on perpetual futures and spot/RWA markets, including crypto assets, tokenized stocks, ETFs, and other real-world assets. Its current product emphasizes Base-heavy deployment, Oyster AMM hybrid liquidity, and an onchain/CLOB-style trading model. Tokenized stocks are described as 1:1 backed rather than synthetic exposure; unsupported options-trading claims should be removed.",
